Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.20,0:00:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wow...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.96,0:00:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So this is Lyrical Monasterio...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.22,0:00:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even a hopeless girl like me,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.64,0:00:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}can definitely become a sparkling idol here...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.16,0:00:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's see...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.15,0:00:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where's the entrance ceremony venue...?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.35,0:00:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.02,0:00:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Eek!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.64,0:00:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you a freshman too?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.68,0:00:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.64,0:00:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, she vanished?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.15,0:00:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.07,0:00:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sup!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.20,0:00:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Santi! I came from DragEm...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.03,0:00:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, Dragon Empire!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.36,0:00:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A gyaru...! How scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.60,0:00:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.11,0:00:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,M-My name is Luvna.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.25,0:00:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a ghost from Dark States...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.08,0:00:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever I get nervous or embarrassed, I turn invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.17,0:00:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,A ghost?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.04,0:00:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That explains it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.40,0:00:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's so close...!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.97,0:00:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is she gonna mug me?{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.52,0:01:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Your skin is so nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.71,0:01:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be because Dark States doesn't get much UV light, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.28,0:01:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, haha... Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.30,0:01:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've seen that phrase:{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.60,0:01:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Gyarus who are nice to otaku" online before...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.39,0:01:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Could she actually just be a nice person...?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.14,0:01:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Luvna-cchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.06,0:01:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.96,0:01:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.69,0:01:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Starting today, we're friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.36,0:01:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Friends with me...? Is this...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.94,0:01:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ababababababa!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.19,0:01:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, my bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.86,0:01:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot I'm a Thunder Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.15,0:01:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}Ghost Meets Gal!{\b0}
